SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The oodd utility is compliant with the IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”)
     specification.

     The flags [--bbccddoossxx] as well as the _o_f_f_s_e_t specifier are marked by IEEE
     Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”) as being an X/Open System Interfaces option.

     The flags [--aaBBDDeeFFffHHhhIIiiLLllOOXX] are extensions to that specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     An oodd command appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

